NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000030 "=head1 DESCRIPTION"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000031 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000032 "This is a backend for L<Package::Stash>, which provides the functionality in a"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000033 "way that's less buggy and much faster. It will be used by default if it's"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000034 "installed, and should be preferred in all environments with a compiler."
